THIRD-PARTY ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS

This software was inspired by and builds upon concepts and ideas from the
following open-source projects. Their original licenses and copyright notices
are preserved in the respective packages. Please refer to
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and the SBOM files (SBOM.cdx.json, SBOM.spdx.json)
for the complete list of bundled dependencies and their license terms.

  - Auto-claude-code-research-in-sleep
    Unattended Claude Code CLI autonomous research execution design,
    task encapsulation and checkpoint/recovery mechanism.

  - ruflo
    Workflow orchestration engine design, skill runner architecture,
    and skill pack management patterns.

  - local-deep-research
    Local offline deep literature search, multi-source aggregation
    design, and systematic review protocol concepts.

  - Rethlas
    Academic document generation approach, LaTeX/DOCX toolchain
    integration patterns, and writing rules framework design.

Note: The above acknowledgements cover design inspiration and conceptual
borrowing. Where code from these projects was directly incorporated, the
applicable original license terms apply and are noted in
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. If you believe your project's license terms require
additional attribution, please open an issue.

